title: $:/plugins/phriendly/tearoff-panes/readme

Open any tiddler in a draggable, resizable pane that floats over the main
story river, without leaving the current window. Panes render through the
normal `ViewTemplate`/`EditTemplate` cascade, so any installed content-type
plugin (parsers, editors) works inside a pane exactly as it does in the main
window.

Panes are pure UI state (`$:/state/tearoff/<tiddler title>`) with no
boot-time restore -- closing or reopening the document, or clicking Home,
clears them the same way any tiddler not listed in `$:/DefaultTiddlers`
would be cleared.
